# Trusted Stage 0 provenance

root_artifact: bootstrap/stage0.aexe
compiler_source: bootstrap/compiler.ardisa
transition_artifact: bootstrap/stage0.transition.aexe
artifact_format: ARDISA-EXEC-V1
trust_boundary: Stage 0 is the checked-in root executable; Rust is executor-only.
regeneration: bootstrap/regenerate_stage0.sh executes the verified native transition compiler against compiler.ardisa, then installs the resulting native compiler as Stage 0.
verification: bootstrap/verify_self_hosting.sh records input and stage hashes and requires Stage 2 == Stage 3.
